{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35733876",
      "title": "Defining & Using Dynamic Routes",
      "sourceHash": "722b35c30a0ae4c1aed647274169d7fd3ae9002de563ac06ccab522acda6aa0d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 5.62,
          "en": "Now to conclude the basics of routing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.62,
          "end": 7.14,
          "en": "there is one last",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.14,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "yet extremely important comment and crucial",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 13.86,
          "en": "feature supported by React Router DOM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.86,
          "end": 16.44,
          "en": "which you will need in almost all applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.44,
          "end": 17.54,
          "en": "you're going to build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.54,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "And for that, let's go back to the products page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 24.12,
          "en": "It's just a dummy page and it will stay a dummy page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.12,
          "end": 27.81,
          "en": "But, there is one thing which we could add here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.81,
          "end": 30.78,
          "en": "which you might want to have in reality.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.78,
          "end": 34.38,
          "en": "Besides just saying something like \"The Product Page\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.38,
          "end": 37.83,
          "en": "it would be quite common to have a list of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.83,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "products on this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 42.24,
          "en": "So here we could have a list where we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.24,
          "end": 45.573,
          "en": "product one, and product two, and product three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.65,
          "end": 47.58,
          "en": "And we could, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.58,
          "end": 49.68,
          "en": "have an infinite amount of products here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.68,
          "end": 52.44,
          "en": "This is just an example afterall.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.44,
          "end": 54.54,
          "en": "Now, it would be quite common to load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.54,
          "end": 58.92,
          "en": "a separate details page for the different products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.92,
          "end": 60.78,
          "en": "And, of course, that is what you have essentially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.78,
          "end": 63.12,
          "en": "on any online shop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.12,
          "end": 64.283,
          "en": "You have a list of products,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.283,
          "end": 65.91,
          "en": "you can click on a product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.91,
          "end": 68.76,
          "en": "to view the details of that product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.76,
          "end": 69.87,
          "en": "Now, in order to do so,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.87,
          "end": 73.38,
          "en": "what you would typically have is a separate page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.38,
          "end": 76.05,
          "en": "maybe called \"Product Detail'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.05,
          "end": 81.05,
          "en": "So the product detail page like this, which we also export.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.31,
          "end": 85.28999999999999,
          "en": "And then here we might want to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.28999999999999,
          "end": 87.66,
          "en": "the product specific data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.66,
          "end": 90.27,
          "en": "Now I'll get back to the product specific part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 91.26,
          "en": "in a couple of minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.26,
          "end": 93.50999999999999,
          "en": "For the moment, I'll just output a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 93.50999999999999,
          "end": 96.207,
          "en": "where I say \"Product Details\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.28999999999999,
          "end": 102.00800000000001,
          "en": "So we wanna load this page here for our different products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.00800000000001,
          "end": 105.24000000000001,
          "en": "Of course, that should be easy enough to do, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 107.756,
          "en": "We add a new route and then we add some links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.756,
          "end": 110.703,
          "en": "But what's now the path for this route?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.6,
          "end": 113.499,
          "en": "Of course, it could be /productdetail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.499,
          "end": 116.75999999999999,
          "en": "But, keep in mind that we typically have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.75999999999999,
          "end": 120.78,
          "en": "different products here with different details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.78,
          "end": 123.69,
          "en": "So whilst we always wanna load the same component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.69,
          "end": 125.82,
          "en": "the data that will be displayed in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.82,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "will be different for the different products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 132.21,
          "en": "And it would make sense to support paths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.21,
          "end": 134.223,
          "en": "like products/P1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 137.85,
          "en": "So the idea of product1 maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.85,
          "end": 139.89,
          "en": "or product-1 like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 141.48,
          "en": "And product-2.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.48,
          "end": 143.136,
          "en": "So, we might have different paths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.136,
          "end": 145.353,
          "en": "for these different products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.49,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "Now we always wanna load the same page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 152.31,
          "en": "We always wanna load the product detail page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.31,
          "end": 155.22,
          "en": "Hence I'm importing that page here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.22,
          "end": 156.99,
          "en": "the \"Product Detail\" page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 156.99,
          "end": 159.45,
          "en": "And I'm defining it as an element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 159.45,
          "end": 161.853,
          "en": "But, we wanna load it for different paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.29,
          "end": 166.98,
          "en": "Now of course we could add multiple paths like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 166.98,
          "end": 169.47,
          "en": "Now we have three route definitions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 169.47,
          "end": 172.2,
          "en": "with slightly different paths.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 172.2,
          "end": 174.9,
          "en": "But that of course is not a realistic approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 174.9,
          "end": 176.73,
          "en": "because the more products we have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 176.73,
          "end": 178.35,
          "en": "the more paths must be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 178.35,
          "end": 180.99,
          "en": "And typically we don't even know in advance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.99,
          "end": 182.46,
          "en": "how many products we'll have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 182.46,
          "end": 185.79,
          "en": "And we also will add more products dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 185.79,
          "end": 188.61,
          "en": "After all, most websites are pretty dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.61,
          "end": 190.505,
          "en": "and users and administrators",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 190.505,
          "end": 193.35,
          "en": "might be able to add new products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 193.35,
          "end": 196.02,
          "en": "We don't want to add it to code all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 196.02,
          "end": 198.78,
          "en": "Just because a new product was added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 198.78,
          "end": 201.63,
          "en": "So hard coding those different product Ids",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 201.63,
          "end": 205.5,
          "en": "in the paths like this, is clearly not an option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 205.5,
          "end": 207.32999999999998,
          "en": "And that's why React Router DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 207.32999999999998,
          "end": 212.32999999999998,
          "en": "supports dynamic path segments or path parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 212.64,
          "end": 214.38,
          "en": "as it's also called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 214.38,
          "end": 217.05,
          "en": "You add a parameter to a path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 217.05,
          "end": 220.07999999999998,
          "en": "So such dynamic path segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 220.07999999999998,
          "end": 223.68,
          "en": "By adding a colon and then any identifier of your choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 223.68,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "like Id or product Id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 228.513,
          "en": "Again, this is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 229.35,
          "end": 231.93,
          "en": "The colon is very important though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 231.93,
          "end": 234.66,
          "en": "This signals to React Router DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 234.66,
          "end": 237.988,
          "en": "that this part of the path is dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 237.988,
          "end": 241.77,
          "en": "So that you so actually don't want to load this element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 241.77,
          "end": 244.95,
          "en": "for /products:/productId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 244.95,
          "end": 248.64,
          "en": "But instead /products/ any value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 248.64,
          "end": 251.37,
          "en": "that will be used as an actual value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 251.37,
          "end": 254.1,
          "en": "for this product Id placeholder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 254.1,
          "end": 257.49,
          "en": "You could thereafter have more hard coded segments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 257.49,
          "end": 260.94,
          "en": "if you needed to, but this segment here is dynamic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 260.94,
          "end": 262.353,
          "en": "if you write it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 263.31,
          "end": 264.63,
          "en": "Now to show you how this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 264.63,
          "end": 268.747,
          "en": "Let's save that and now let's simply manually enter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 268.747,
          "end": 271.08,
          "en": "/product/P1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 271.08,
          "end": 274.01,
          "en": "And you see we load the product details page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 274.01,
          "end": 275.787,
          "en": "/product-2",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 276.81,
          "end": 278.58,
          "en": "And we stay on this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 278.58,
          "end": 280.53,
          "en": "Or /abc",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 280.53,
          "end": 283.95,
          "en": "So /products/abc that is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 285.54,
          "end": 288.99,
          "en": "So now we load the same component for all these paths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 288.99,
          "end": 291.45,
          "en": "because the part after /products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 291.45,
          "end": 294.75,
          "en": "is dynamic and we can plug in any value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 294.75,
          "end": 297.514,
          "en": "of our choice for this placeholder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 297.514,
          "end": 300.57,
          "en": "Now this placeholder here becomes important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 300.57,
          "end": 302.67,
          "en": "once we wanna start loading different data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 302.67,
          "end": 305.88,
          "en": "for the different products in our case though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 305.88,
          "end": 308.12,
          "en": "So we added this dynamic route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 308.12,
          "end": 310.77,
          "en": "or this route with a dynamic path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 310.77,
          "end": 313.32,
          "en": "Now let's say, that on \"Product Detail\" page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 313.32,
          "end": 314.64,
          "en": "we of course wanna know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 314.64,
          "end": 317.97,
          "en": "for which exact product this page was loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 317.97,
          "end": 320.82,
          "en": "We wanna know which product Id was used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 320.82,
          "end": 322.102,
          "en": "so that we could, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 322.102,
          "end": 325.11,
          "en": "reach out to backend API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 325.11,
          "end": 326.862,
          "en": "and a database to fetch the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 326.862,
          "end": 330.903,
          "en": "for that specific product and display it on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 332.01,
          "end": 334.17,
          "en": "And of course, that's also a common scenario.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 334.17,
          "end": 337.53,
          "en": "And therefore React Router DOM gives us another tool",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 337.53,
          "end": 340.56,
          "en": "for getting hold of the actual value used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 340.56,
          "end": 343.05,
          "en": "instead of that placeholder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 343.05,
          "end": 345.342,
          "en": "Instead of :product id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 345.342,
          "end": 349.2,
          "en": "And that tool which we get from React Router DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 349.2,
          "end": 352.293,
          "en": "is to useParans hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 353.34000000000003,
          "end": 356.126,
          "en": "This hook gives us a parans object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 356.126,
          "end": 358.03,
          "en": "if we call it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 358.03,
          "end": 361.48,
          "en": "And this parans object is a simple JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 361.48,
          "end": 365.73,
          "en": "which contains every dynamic path segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 365.73,
          "end": 369.66,
          "en": "we defined in our route definition as a property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 369.66,
          "end": 371.28,
          "en": "So in my case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 371.28,
          "end": 375.84,
          "en": "I got a property called productId on this parans object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 375.84,
          "end": 379.14,
          "en": "because in my route definition I chose productId",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 379.14,
          "end": 382.35,
          "en": "as an identifier for this placeholder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 382.35,
          "end": 386.88,
          "en": "for this path parameter, for this dynamic path segment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 386.88,
          "end": 390.6,
          "en": "So the part after the colon that is the identifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
